WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:34.600
Ok. Hold on.

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:36.720
It’s only rivalry.

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:39.000
&lt;i&gt; Commentator: Can Anthony Edwards live up to the hype? &lt;/i&gt;

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:41.040
It’s only noise.

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:44.680
It’s only hard work.

00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:45.760
It’s only a game,

00:00:46.840 --> 00:00:47.520
…a block,

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:48.840
…a serve.

00:00:50.760 --> 00:00:52.760
It’s only a number.

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:58.560
It’s only breaking the laws of gravity.

00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:03.800
It’s only getting back up,

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:05.600
…and up,

00:01:07.680 --> 00:01:08.320
…and up!

00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:22.000
It’s only a jump.

